WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.170
<v Dana, security desk>So, an email surprises you. Pause: don't click, reply or forward.

2
00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:11.450
<v Dana, security desk>Check who really sent it, and where the link goes. Then press Report.

3
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:17.840
<v Dana, security desk>Clicked, or typed a password? Call the desk on 4444, straight away.
